    "title": "Who are the ex-high school stars from West Montgomery County area competing on Saturday, Dec. 20?",
    "text": "These former West Montgomery County area high school athletes are set to compete on Saturday, Dec. 20.\nKJ Cochran\nSanta Clara Broncos\nGuard\nFreshman\n6′5″ 195\nPerkiomen School\nHometown: West Chester\nNext Game: vs. Loyola Ramblers, Saturday, Dec. 20, 2 p.m.\nKyle Shawaluk\nKutztown Golden Bears\nForward and guard\nFreshman\n6′5″ 190\nPerkiomen School\nHometown: Collegeville\nNext Game: vs. Clarion Golden Eagles, Saturday, Dec. 20, 3 p.m.\nLuca Baratta\nScranton Royals\nGuard\nSenior\n6′2″\nPerkiomen School\nHometown: Richboro\nNext Game: vs. Nazareth Golden Flyers, Saturday, Dec. 20, 2 p.m.\nTommy Kelly\nLock Haven Bald Eagles\nForward\nFreshman\n6′5″ 175\nSpring-Ford Area High School\nHometown: Collegeville\nNext Game: vs. California Vulcans, Saturday, Dec. 20, 3 p.m.",
